# PaperFlux Architecture Specification v2.0

High-Performance Arabic PDF to Markdown Engine

Module Overview: pdf2md-core, pdf2md-layout, pdf2md-table

<!-- pagebreak: page 2 -->

## Engine Performance SLAs

| Metric | SLA Target | Unit |
|---|---|---|
| Single-Page Latency | < 5.0 | ms |
| Memory per Worker | < 64 | MB |
| Parallel Throughput | > 200 | pages/sec |

<!-- pagebreak: page 3 -->

## CLI Deployment Instructions

Command: cargo build --release -p pdf2md-cli

Binary Location: target/release/pdf2md
